        103.03939819335938,
        106.6666259765625,
        513.28466796875,
        122.00062561035156
      ],
      "text": "In settings of low HIV prevalence, all household and close contacts of people",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        119.86663818359375,
        510.2485656738281,
        135.2006378173828
      ],
      "text": "with TB who have symptoms compatible with TB disease may be offered coun-",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        133.066650390625,
        416.0224609375,
        148.40065002441406
      ],
      "text": "selling and testing for HIV as part of their clinical evaluation",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        158.588134765625,
        395.3228454589844,
        171.93963623046875
      ],
      "text": "(Conditional recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        183.32461547851562,
        510.2310485839844,
        196.7451171875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        197.12460327148438,
        510.2309875488281,
        210.54510498046875
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organiza-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        210.99359130859375,
        270.99639892578125,
        224.3450927734375
      ],
      "text": "tion, 2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
