        85.04139709472656,
        235.5230712890625,
        213.58839416503906,
        249.15057373046875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendation 24 n",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        259.2666015625,
        513.2955322265625,
        274.6005859375
      ],
      "text": "All household contacts of an index case who is a PLHIV should be counselled",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        103.03939819335938,
        272.46661376953125,
        197.16636657714844,
        287.80059814453125
      ],
      "text": "and tested for HIV",
      "font": "Arial-BoldMT",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        297.98809814453125,
        370.8279113769531,
        311.339599609375
      ],
      "text": "(Strong recommendation, very low quality of evidence)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        322.724609375,
        510.2310485839844,
        336.1451110839844
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations for investigating contacts of persons with infectious tu- Source:",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        336.52459716796875,
        510.2309875488281,
        349.9450988769531
      ],
      "text": "berculosis in low- and middle-income countries.  Geneva, World Health Organiza-",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        102.88939666748047,
        350.3935852050781,
        270.99639892578125,
        363.7450866699219
      ],
      "text": "tion, 2012 (WHO/HTM/TB/2012.9)",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        374.0487060546875,
        513.5714111328125,
        390.7767028808594
      ],
      "text": "Implementation considerations with respect to managing child contacts",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        388.4486999511719,
        168.37939453125,
        405.17669677734375
      ],
      "text": "within the NTP",
      "font": "Arial-BoldItalicMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        412.1882019042969,
        513.3798828125,
        425.5397033691406
      ],
      "text": "Close contact screening and management are recommended by most NTPs but rarely",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        428.1156921386719,
        513.3914794921875,
        441.53619384765625
      ],
      "text": "(23).  happen in low- and middle-income settings where most childhood TB occurs",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        444.1811828613281,
        513.3915405273438,
        457.5326843261719
      ],
      "text": "There is no need to create a separate infrastructure to support contact screening and",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        460.17767333984375,
        513.4489135742188,
        473.5291748046875
      ],
      "text": "management: it is possible to work within the existing NTP structure and with existing",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        476.1741638183594,
        513.4375610351562,
        489.5256652832031
      ],
      "text": "specialist support. A symptom-based screening approach allows for the implementation",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        492.170654296875,
        508.239501953125,
        505.52215576171875
      ],
      "text": "of contact management at community level without the need for additional resources.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        516.6771850585938,
        513.4949340820312,
        530.0286865234375
      ],
      "text": "All NTPs should have written guidelines for the use of, and approaches to, contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        532.6046752929688,
        513.4376220703125,
        546.025146484375
      ],
      "text": "(12) investigation  . Written standardized protocols and procedures should be developed",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        548.6701049804688,
        513.471923828125,
        562.0216064453125
      ],
      "text": "and followed. Such protocols improve the efficiency and uniformity of contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        564.6666259765625,
        513.3798217773438,
        578.0181274414062
      ],
      "text": "investigation and allow continuous evaluation of the activity. As a minimum, protocols",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        580.6631469726562,
        513.4375,
        594.0146484375
      ],
      "text": "should include priorities for contact investigation, describe roles and responsibilities of",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        596.6596069335938,
        493.8184509277344,
        610.0111083984375
      ],
      "text": "health workers, and provide guidance on collecting and recording of relevant data.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        621.1661376953125,
        513.4718627929688,
        634.5176391601562
      ],
      "text": "Figure 2 provides an example of a contact screening register. Sample forms for contact",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        637.1626586914062,
        513.4606323242188,
        650.51416015625
      ],
      "text": "investigation, household contact screening and household TB contact roster are available",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        653.0901489257812,
        234.5853729248047,
        666.5106201171875
      ],
      "text": "(12) in other WHO guidelines .",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
